const description = '如何結合居家看護與醫院看護的資源？本文深入介紹高雄居家看護的服務內容、高雄醫院看護的專業特色，以及如何為家人打造雙重的照護保障。';
const date = '2026-06-15';
const keywords = ['高雄居家看護', '高雄醫院看護'];
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} type="article">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
    {JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": title,
      "description": description,
      "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "宇涵居家照護站"},
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "宇涵居家照護站",
        "logo": {"@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://yuhanhomecare.com/images/logo.png"}
      },
      "datePublished": date,
      "dateModified": date,
      "mainEntityOfPage": {"@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://yuhanhomecare.com/blog/home-hospital-guide-20260615/"},
      "keywords": keywords.join(', '),
      "inLanguage": "zh-TW"
    })}
  </script>

  <article class="bg-[#fcfaf6] min-h-screen">
    <div class="bg-[#2b221c] py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
